"c-shiji-056-chen:p017","text":"孝惠帝六年，相國曹參卒，以安國侯王陵爲右丞相，陳平爲左丞相。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m017-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4wc_97x_2gd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m017-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"曹參","kind":"person","person_id":"a0z_bx1_tnh","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m017-0013","start":13,"end":18,"surface":"安國侯王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"78k_der_mz8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m017-0023","start":23,"end":25,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"04f_hzf_n06","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","book_id":"b-shiji-056","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:p019","text":"安國侯既爲右丞相，二歳，孝惠帝崩。高后欲立諸呂爲王，問王陵，王陵曰：「不可。」問陳平，陳平曰：「可。」呂太后怒，乃詳遷陵爲帝太傅，實不用陵。陵怒，謝疾免，杜門竟不朝請，七年而卒。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m019-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"安國侯","kind":"person","person_id":"78k_der_mz8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m019-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"孝惠帝","kind":"person","person_id":"4wc_97x_2gd","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m019-0017","start":17,"end":19,"surface":"高后","kind":"person","person_id":"ky4_4k8_gjt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m019-0021","start":21,"end":23,"surface":"諸呂","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m019-0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"78k_der_mz8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m019-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"王陵","kind":"person","person_id":"78k_der_mz8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-